        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This waistband was part of a wedding outfit worn by the bride at a peasant wedding in the district between Quimperlé and Pont-Aven, Finistère.\n\nPurchased (16 to 20-1902, £25). Registered File number 36225/1901. See also RP 90589/1901, (file) RP 2353/1902."@en ;
